          "Festival must be completed within 2 days",
          "Budget cannot be exceeded",
          "All events must be inclusive"
        ],
        "problems": [
          "Main artist cancels last minute",
          "Sound system malfunction",
          "Unexpected rain on outdoor events"
        ]
      },
      "expected_solutions": ["Alternative entertainment", "Backup equipment", "Indoor contingency"],
      "olq_mapping": ["Organising Ability", "Ability to Influence the Group", "Social Adaptability"]
